#: linkpage.cpp:29
msgid ""
"Finally, I would advise you to create some links to important ressources on "
"the net for you. All information about KDE will be only one mouseclick away. "
"Just click the icon to create the link."
msgstr ""
"Fine mi rekomendas krei kelkajn ligojn al gravaj retejoj. Æiuj informoj "
"pri KDE estos alireblaj per sola muskliko."
"Simple kliku sur la piktogramon por krei ligon."

